      "writtenOn": "2021-12-21T18:18:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you\u0027re probably aware of this, but the most common scenario in real life would be to plug in a charger (fixed or variable source PDO) to a mobile device (battery SNK PDO). In those cases, you would need to extract fields for comparison purposes differently for each PDO. But this is fine for now if it helps us write the tests we want.",
