        "id": 1511343
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-22T15:22:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not 100% sure, but when I was reading documentation, I thought that sink capabilities are PDOs that are satisfying for that sink. E.g. even if mobile device has battery, it can have fixed sink capability, because it doesn\u0027t have voltage stabilizer, so it needs specific voltage for charging. And sink is just looking for source PDO that is matching its own capabilities.",
      "parentUuid": "65d176de_4172a554",
      "revId": "57de95b038ca9db52b9d44e83b481eb31f103731",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
