        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-22T19:34:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right. Can you add a comment here anyway noting that this if statement will only be true for the vSafe5V sink PDO?",
      "parentUuid": "568b711d_5580c016",
      "revId": "57de95b038ca9db52b9d44e83b481eb31f103731",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
