      "message": "I think I must have misread this. I\u0027m not 100% sure what I was thinking at the time. But after rereading spec section 6.4.1.3.3, I think you are doing basically the right thing here. PDO_BATT_MAX_POWER should probably be called something like PDO_BATT_OP_POWER, but that\u0027s out of scope here.\n\nI think you should probably also return mismatch if the min voltage of the sink PDO is greater than the max voltage of the source PDO.",
